Postgres icon from iTerm2 PR 389

-

Termurion: this folder is iTerm2's tab icon set, copied from iTerm2's tree
(ThirdParty/hyper-tab-icons-plus: graphic_icons.json, graphic_colors.json, png/ and this
file). png/graphic_emacs.png and png/graphic_emacs@2x.png are iTerm2's own first-party icons
(images/FirstPartyTabIcons), under iTerm2's license: COPYING-iTerm2 is iTerm2's COPYING
(GPL v2 or later) and LICENSE-iTerm2 is iTerm2's LICENSE, the full license text, both copied
verbatim from iTerm2's tree.
